celkatikku |amaint›­ _ |ekkàlattum |ulakavà©vil |u©alutalukku |uriya ceyalkaëaiy› ceytuvanta |añiy›­, "|i­i |iva­ |ulakavà©kkaiyil |u©alupava­ |àkà­; paramapatattil›y› |iruppiñam |uñaiyava­ |àvà­" |e­­umpañi takuti peŸŸ›­; cellakkañava kati _ paramapatam. |aïkuëëàruë |oruva­àmpañi niŸaivàëa­ |àyi­›­. "|à©vãr! `kaõñavà tiritant›­' |e­Ÿu kåŸi­ãr. `teëëiy›­ |à­›­' |e­kiŸãr. |ivai |o­Ÿa­ukku |o­Ÿu muraõpañña coŸŸoñarkaëàka |uëëa­av›?" |e­Ÿu vi­ava,
cikke­at tiruvaruë peŸŸ›­ _ "|i­i, mãëàtapañi |aruëaippeŸŸ›­!" |e­kiŸàr. "nãrpeŸŸap›Ÿutà­ yàtu?" |e­­a,
