|añiy›Ÿku |aruëày› _ ni­ tirum›­iya©ak› nukarattakka |i­pam |e­Ÿu |irukki­Ÿa |añiy›­ai |ita­ai nukarntiñumàŸu ceytaruëal v›õñum. (93)

94. |uõñày_|uŸim›l naŸu ney |amutu |àka;
