{kã©ppàñalil `kuŸikkë |e­ai nãy›' |e­Ÿu |emperumà­ai v›õñiya |à©vàr, |ippàñalil |emperumà­ `|e­ ne¤cil |uëà­›' |e­Ÿu tàm karututaŸkuriya toñarpaik kuŸippiñukiŸàr}
pa_rai. :ñã ma­­à |imma­icappiŸaviyai nãkki _ nilaiyillàta |imma­itap piŸaviyaip pkki; ta­ |àkkit ta­ |i­­aruë ceyyum talaiva­ _ ta­akku |añiyava­àkat ta­­uñaiya |i­iya karuõaiyaic ceyyum talaiva­ày; mi­ |àr mukil c›r tiruv›ïkañam m›ya _ mi­­al niŸainta m›kaïkaë poruntiya tirumalaiyil virumpit taïkiyiruppava­ày; |e­ |à­ai |e­ |appa­ _ |e­akku yà­aiplak kàõñaŸku |i­iya­ày, |e­akkup p›rutavi ceyki­Ÿava­ày; |e­ ne¤cil |uëà­› _ |e­ |uëëattil nilaiyàka |uëëà­.
peri. mu­. : "|à©vãr! nãr |umpakkal nàm varutalai nãr vilakkàmalirukkum kàlattai |etirnkkiyirukkum nàm |ummai |irantuv›õñumàŸu ceytuvaippm?" |e­Ÿu kåŸi, |e mperumà­ |à©vàruñaiya |icaivu kiññiya |aëavil |avaruñaiya ne¤cil› vantu pukuntà­.
